calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, February to March and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025 that middle ran 208% of normal in April to May and just 27% in November to December. Grid 19652 had its driest year in 1980 at 58%.</p>"}
